# Workflow trigger marker

This file is watched by `.github/workflows/extract-diagrams.yml`. Updating it on
a `claude/**` branch triggers a fresh extraction run with the defaults baked
into the workflow's `env:` block:

  PDF:           docs/corpus/jpdubois_perfectionnement_combinaisons_V4.pdf
  PAGES:         5-90
  MAX_DIAGRAMS:  0
  MODEL:         claude-sonnet-4-6
  TARGET_BRANCH: main

To trigger with custom inputs, use the manual `workflow_dispatch` flow instead
(Actions tab in the GitHub UI).

